25
00:03:14,245 --> 00:03:17,008
Let me explain a little bit about the format here.

26
00:03:17,028 --> 00:03:21,455
The qualification process for the diving here in Nanjing is a little involved.

27
00:03:21,474 --> 00:03:26,383
FINA held an official qualifying competition in March in Guadalajara in Mexico.

28
00:03:26,723 --> 00:03:34,655
The top nine divers in each event won qualifying places for these games for their country and not just themselves.

29
00:03:35,275 --> 00:03:41,163
So a number of the divers from that competition are not here, but their countries are still represented.

30
00:03:41,144 --> 00:03:48,283
Then the host China was guaranteed a place of course and there were two more universality places which could be offered.

31
00:03:48,304 --> 00:03:56,165
For example in this event the extra place was granted to Canada who are of course extremely strong in women's diving.

32
00:03:56,145 --> 00:03:58,750
The format is also a little different.

33
00:03:59,151 --> 00:04:01,814
Eight dives for the women today at 10 meter.

34
00:04:02,194 --> 00:04:07,903
Four dives with a total degree of difficulty adding up to no more than 7.6.

35
00:04:09,306 --> 00:04:14,233
Just seeing here the divers who will be getting us underway this morning.

36
00:04:15,395 --> 00:04:16,877
Each of them with eight dives.

37
00:04:17,257 --> 00:04:20,802
These dives are chosen from four specified routes.

38
00:04:21,290 --> 00:04:27,675
Then there are four more dives without any degree of difficulty limit, where the divers have a free rein to show us what they can do.

39
00:04:28,177 --> 00:04:30,439
These are also drawn from a range of groups.

40
00:04:30,459 --> 00:04:37,807
That does sound a little bit complicated, but don't worry too much about the technicalities, just sit back and enjoy the show.

41
00:04:38,387 --> 00:04:49,879
One other difference I should point out, which will help to make this morning even more competitive, the marks from the first four dives, those are the ones in the limited category, are carried into the final.

42
00:04:50,146 --> 00:04:55,961
