48
00:05:25,920 --> 00:05:30,386
allocate points out of ten in half a point of grades.

49
00:05:31,047 --> 00:05:33,629
Each nine has allocated a degree of difficulty.

50
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:44,963
Seven judges, the top two marks, the lowest two marks, are all discarded and the middle three marks are then multiplied by the degree of difficulty.

51
00:05:45,103 --> 00:05:46,846
